    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Missing Data and Labels\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Compare how AI handles missing data when the data has clear labels and when the labels are removed.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**1. Test the Mystery Records data.**\r\n\r\n* In `script.js`, find the `data` dataset and ask AI Tutor to fill in the missing values in that dataset.\r\n\r\n**3. Compare the results.**\r\n\r\n* Answer the questions in `notes.md` to compare the code generated for that dataset.\r\n",
